  "consts": [
   "core/parsers/matrix_2axis.py - color x size x inseam grid (COLIN'S trousers).\n\nTwo modes, selected by the recipe:\n\n1. Total grid (default, e.g. LPP/XL901 when no section_anchor): parse the single\n   aggregate COLOR grid on the first page -> one OrderEntity per PO.\n\n2. Per-destination (recipe.section_anchor + destination_anchor set, i.e. COLIN'S):\n   parse the \"DESTINATION DETAILS\" block, emitting ONE OrderEntity per destination.\n   Each destination carries its own Delivery Date and its own size allocation, so the\n   inseam axis is kept on the OrderLine (template_a sums it into one color row) and\n   the destination's delivery date survives into its own PO block.\n\nEach color block reads like:\n    COLOR NO : DCM DARK CAMEL\n    30 31 32 33 34 36 38 TOTAL        <- size header (waist columns, by x-position)\n    30 249 276 264 279 1.068          <- inseam 30, qty per size (dropped zeros omitted)\n    32 314 262 371 331 407 334 250 2.269\n    34 263 244 262 269 185 1.223\n    TOTAL: 314 511 ...                 <- sum row (skipped)\nQuantities align to size columns by X-position, so dropped zeros are fine.\n",
   0,
